{"title":"2004.12906 Towards causal generative scene models via competition of experts","markdown":{"headingText":"2004.12906 Towards causal generative scene models via competition of experts","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Julius von Kügelgen, Ivan Ustyuzhaninov, Peter Gehler, Matthias Bethge, Bernhard Schölkopf，2020-04-27，arXiv:2004.12906（ICLR 2020 workshop \"Causal learning for decision making\"）\n- **一句话定位**：提出 ECON（Ensemble of Competing Object Networks），一个按\"枯叶模型（dead leaves model）\"分层生成场景的无监督组合式生成模型：一组专家生成器通过竞争解释场景的不同区域，自发专门化于不同物体类，从而支持物体级可控采样与符合遮挡物理的重组合。\n\n- **研究问题**：VAE/GAN 等生成模型一次性整体生成图像，缺乏对场景组合性（物体、深度排序、遮挡）的显式建模；已有无监督场景分解模型（MONET、IODINE、GENESIS）使用全局表示空间，不能以新的物体数量和深度次序生成场景（GENESIS 用加性而非分层合成，样本有空洞/残缺物体）。\n\n- **模型与方法**：假设数据由分层过程生成：t=1..T 依次采样物体类 k_t、属性 z_t（先验 N(0,I)）、完整形状 m_t∈{0,1}^D 与外观 x_t，并按 x ← m_t⊙x_t+(1−m_t)⊙x 放置到画布，最终合成 x=Σ_t r_t⊙x_t；关键在形状 m_t 独立抽取而可见区域 r_t = s_t⊙m_t 经 scope 变量 s_T=1, s_t=s_{t+1}⊙(1−m_{t+1}) 相互依赖，显式编码遮挡。ECON 用 K 个专家（各自的注意力网络 a_k、编码器 g_k、解码器 f_k）实现类条件 ELBO（式 13：重构项 L̂x + β KL_z + γ 区域 KL_r），推断按生成逆序（前景到背景）贪心进行：每步所有专家竞争，按 P(k̂_t=k)∝exp(−λL̂x,t(k)+L̂r,t(k))（随机胜者选取以防坍缩）选出赢家，仅更新赢家，并以 s_{t−1}=s_t⊙(1−r̃) 更新 scope；由于 KL 项中 p(r_t|s_t,z,k)=Bernoulli(s_t⊙m̃(z)) 只在 scope 内约束形状，解码器可补全被遮挡物体的完整形状 m_t。K=1 时退化为 MONET 的生成模型扩展。\n\n- **主要命题/定理**：无编号定理，理论贡献是推导类条件 ELBO 及 O(K·T) 的贪心竞争推断（替代穷举 O(K^T)）；与 MONET/IODINE/GENESIS/M-RBM 的对照表（Table 1）表明 ECON 是唯一同时满足\"分解场景、生成与训练分布相似的连贯场景、可控地以新组合重生成物体\"三项的模型（推断非摊销式、较慢）。实验为定性结果：在三角形/方形/圆形 sprite 的合成遮挡数据上（固定颜色与随机颜色两种设定），专家分别专门化于不同物体类与背景；模型能分解训练中从未见过的含 4 个物体（含同类多个、同色多个）的场景，补全被遮挡物体形状，并通过逐层采样指定物体个数与类别生成新场景；仅凭形状专门化（颜色随机化）更难，出现方/圆专家分离不完全。\n\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：是把 ICM/模块化归纳偏置（Parascandolo et al. 2018 竞争独立机制、Locatello 2018 专家混合）引入视觉场景因果生成模型（causal generative scene model）的代表作：物体即独立可干预模块，分层合成即遮挡的因果机制，与 1911.10500 提出的因果表示学习议程直接衔接；作者自述局限包括 K 需预知、像素条件独立假设、仅在玩具数据验证等。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"2004.12906.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-citation":"引用格式","appendix-attribution-cite-as":"请按如下格式引用：","appen